{"4030360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Undertaker", "steam_appid": 4030360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a hunter in the cursed lands of Transylvania. Navigate horror-inspiring gothic environments, fight eldritch creatures, and uncover ancient artifacts in this atmospheric first-person shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/8bfae2f5bc34717ff7c6a9e032bae537.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1232 height=133 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/95529c94a81600cfc991412aec038ae5.poster.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/95529c94a81600cfc991412aec038ae5.webm?t=1787705991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/95529c94a81600cfc991412aec038ae5.mp4?t=1787705991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through The Vale, a shadowed Transylvanian landscape full of both danger and hidden secrets. As you traverse the open world, you'll encounter forgotten backwoods, abandoned villages, and crumbling ruins to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/c7c2f549583a321d52cf9e0197bfd344.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1232 height=133 /></span><strong>  </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/7161981f238053d54a689c3260870cef.poster.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/7161981f238053d54a689c3260870cef.webm?t=1787705991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/7161981f238053d54a689c3260870cef.mp4?t=1787705991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your weapons and skill in tense, tactical combat against cursed creatures. Hunt lurking werewolves, giant spiders, and ghouls through the fog. Pick them off carefully, or just go in guns-blazing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Roam through a dense open-world environment filled with secrets to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover hundreds of unique artifacts, each with distinct abilities and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find the unusual survivors of The Vale and help them out, or don't.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/768a78c27547a01df14b84fe462f9cfc.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1232 height=133 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/a3d6f03e05fa246c3e32f5e18766eca6.poster.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/a3d6f03e05fa246c3e32f5e18766eca6.webm?t=1787705991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/a3d6f03e05fa246c3e32f5e18766eca6.mp4?t=1787705991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match weapons, artifacts, and gear to create the perfect setup for your hunt. Experiment with combinations to uncover synergies and new strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your equipment, artifacts, and weaponry to best suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Perform occult rituals to gain unnatural abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find traders to buy and sell just about anything that isn't nailed down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a hunter in the cursed lands of Transylvania. Navigate horror-inspiring gothic environments, fight eldritch creatures, and uncover ancient artifacts in this atmospheric first-person shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/8bfae2f5bc34717ff7c6a9e032bae537.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1232 height=133 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/95529c94a81600cfc991412aec038ae5.poster.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/95529c94a81600cfc991412aec038ae5.webm?t=1787705991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/95529c94a81600cfc991412aec038ae5.mp4?t=1787705991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through The Vale, a shadowed Transylvanian landscape full of both danger and hidden secrets. As you traverse the open world, you'll encounter forgotten backwoods, abandoned villages, and crumbling ruins to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/c7c2f549583a321d52cf9e0197bfd344.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1232 height=133 /></span><strong>  </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/7161981f238053d54a689c3260870cef.poster.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/7161981f238053d54a689c3260870cef.webm?t=1787705991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/7161981f238053d54a689c3260870cef.mp4?t=1787705991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your weapons and skill in tense, tactical combat against cursed creatures. Hunt lurking werewolves, giant spiders, and ghouls through the fog. Pick them off carefully, or just go in guns-blazing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Roam through a dense open-world environment filled with secrets to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover hundreds of unique artifacts, each with distinct abilities and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find the unusual survivors of The Vale and help them out, or don't.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030360/extras/768a78c27547a01df14b84fe462f9cfc.avif?t=1787705991\" width=1232 height=133 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><v